1. Emit `status=OK|NO_SIGNAL|INSUFFICIENT_SAMPLE` and `n=<trades>`; `win_rate=N/A` when `trades==0`.
2. Emit `charts=N` (actual file count); fail loudly if `N==0` when `trades>0`.
3. Log per-gate pass counts: `bars_passed_ema`, `bars_passed_gex`, `bars_passed_sr`, `bars_passed_atr`, `bars_passed_all`.
4. Log `gex_coverage=X/Y`; abort with explicit error if below threshold.
